 like so much  overtime to chew but i would also bet  that a lot of this is water weight not  fat loss from the very low carb intake  so what are my overall thoughts on rebel  wilson's mayor method diet well despite  its celebrity endorsement and hiding  behind trendy wellness terms like gut  health and mindfulness let's call a  spade a spade the mare method is a  restrictive diet that uses every sneaky  tool in the pseudoscience toolbox to  make you eat less and suck the pleasure  out of food its laundry list of rules  promotes the opposite of what it claims  to and long term may actually be  detrimental to our gut so while there  may be some merit to certain elements of  the mare method like prioritizing  breakfast limiting distractions at  mealtimes and being mindful of sugar and  ultra processed foods it's never going  to support a full well-nourished life so  on that note that's all that i have for  you guys today thank you again to  billbar for sponsoring if you like this  video be sure to give it the thumbs up  leave me a comment below on who or what  you'd like to see me review next  subscribe to the channel and i'll see  you next time on abby's kitchen bye  [Music]
 

